This is Civilian — a civic engagement web app.

Tech stack:
- Next.js 16, Pages Router (NOT App Router)
- React 19
- Tailwind CSS 4
- InsForge for database (lib/insforge.js) — NOT Supabase, NOT Prisma
- NextAuth.js v5 for authentication (when you implement auth — not required for unrelated tasks)
- Anthropic Claude SDK for AI features
- Mapbox + react-map-gl for maps
- Framer Motion for animations
- Resend for email

Environment variables — use ONLY these names (lib/insforge.js and .env.example):
- NEXT_PUBLIC_INSFORGE_BASE_URL
- NEXT_PUBLIC_INSFORGE_ANON_KEY
Do NOT use INSFORGE_API_KEY, INSFORGE_PROJECT_URL, INSFORGE_URL, or INSFORGE_ANON_KEY unless you are migrating the codebase intentionally.

